Z||000008||pontiacs4me||08-12-2001||04:18 AM||||that car is plain wicked, I just want my fiero fast enough to beat an all stock 93-94 rt10.  Theres only about 4 vipers around here, 1 see one constantly, I dont have to worry about a hennessey 800 pulling up next to me at a stoplight.  But its going to be real funny when this cocky assho!e with a 94 rt10 pulls up next to me one night at a stoplight.  <BR>So one night im up at a gas station by my house, and I pull into a pump stall, and beside me sits an old style rt10.  I pump my gas and on my way into the station to pay, I see the guy walking out to his car.  I say "wanna race" (btw I was driving my firebird, not the fiero) he says "Ill smoke you" I said "yeah you will" then I say "a good friend of mine wants to race you, we see you driving around all the time, and he thinks he can take you"  he asks me what he has, I proceed to tell him he has a 91 lumina with a 3800 supercharged in it. (check out <A HREF="http://www.luminasupercharged.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.luminasupercharged.com</A>  ) He says "Ill beat him too".  I said "probably not by much then".  so I asked him what he has done to it.  He tells me he put a cold air system on it, and upgraded the exhaust.  He says it added 50 horsepower.  Then he says it runs mid 11's but he hasnt taken it to the track yet.  I said that car only makes 400 hp stock, and it ran 13.20 stock.  If he added 50 hp (which I doubt) and picked up almost 2 seconds, damn, I give him a major thumbs up on that.  BUT I DONT THINK SO, so I tell him where my friend lives.  which is right on a major street, where we see this fool drive by every other day.  One day he will stop by, or we will flag him down, and watch him get whipped by a v6 lumina.  Were going to video tape it too.  and put it on the website.  check out the website if you want, this car is really cool.||||reg||1
Z||000009||maryjane||08-12-2001||05:33 AM||||If I hadn't read it from a reputable mag like that, I would not have believed it.<BR>Gone....in less than 3 secs. I used to live near Hou, no way I'd have let em drive it on those streets. What a car.||||reg||1
